=\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-302603 hdp.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/26/Spine_static-302603_hdp.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"293\" height=\"398\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"293\" data-file-height=\"398\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3026\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%A2%E6%96%97%E7%AF%B7\" title=\"红斗篷\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%A2%E6%96%97%E7%AF%B7\" title=\"红斗篷\"><img alt=\"红斗篷\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-302601.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-302601.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-302601.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%A2%E6%96%97%E7%AF%B7\" title=\"红斗篷\">红斗篷</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.4</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>永不沉没号</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：302603</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">这里的一切和她曾经熟识的环境大为不同。<br />桅杆如同遮天蔽日的乔木，每一道暗流都是野兽的呼吸——但没关系，一个优秀的猎人能够适应所有的环境。更何况，她还有那柄猎枪。它曾来自于母亲的母亲，最终传递给唯一活下来的女儿。<br />夜深了，蓝丝绒的天幕渐渐垂下，喧闹连同灯光一起次第熄灭。她完成了一天的船员工作，但并未回到她的舱室——夜晚还没有结束。<br />女孩拿起了那把银色的“伞”，抬头望向天际的满月。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"302603\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302604.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/be/Belonging-302604.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">红雨靴<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Red Rain Boots</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />0.8<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>红色的船用雨靴，为邮轮的海员统一配发。<br />PVC材料与钢质底板能够为小水手抵御穿刺和侵蚀，在她匆匆越过甲板、于雨后的海风中继续追猎之时。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302605.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/5c/Belonging-302605.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“雨伞”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Umbrella\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />10<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一柄细长的猎枪，隐藏在细心叠好的伞褶中，以免引发乘客的恐慌。<br />直至扣下扳机为止，鲜少有人预料到跃出的不是伞面，而是猎人的银弹。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302606.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1e/Belonging-302606.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">危机措施<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Last Resort</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />72<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>含有密封火药的银质枪弹，在水下亦可击发。<br />受访者指出佩绳上的一个丝结：“之前那颗消耗在了穿越环礁的路上。现在，它是仅剩的纪念与珍藏。”</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E6%9E%AA%E7%AE%A11.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 银枪管1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E6%9E%AA%E7%AE%A11.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E6%9E%AA%E7%AE%A11.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E6%9E%AA%E7%AE%A11.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E6%9E%AA%E7%AE%A11.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E6%9E%AA%E7%AE%A11.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E6%9E%AA%E7%AE%A11.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E6%9E%AA%E7%AE%A12.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 银枪管2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E6%9E%AA%E7%AE%A12.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E6%9E%AA%E7%AE%A12.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E6%9E%AA%E7%AE%A12.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E6%9E%AA%E7%AE%A12.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E6%9E%AA%E7%AE%A12.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%93%B6%E6%9E%AA%E7%AE%A12.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">银枪管 <small style=\"color: grey\">Silver Schirm</small></span></span>"}}